Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gary Newell
Installed-Size: 35
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Keyboard shortcut HUD for the i3 window manager
 A lightweight Python/Tkinter HUD that displays i3 keyboard
 shortcuts and provides an editor for custom shortcut descriptions.
